This repository redistributes and adapts content from the OWASP Web Security
Testing Guide (WSTG), version 4.2.

Original work:
  Title:   OWASP Web Security Testing Guide v4.2
  Author:  The OWASP Foundation and WSTG contributors
  Source:  https://owasp.org/www-project-web-security-testing-guide/
  Repo:    https://github.com/OWASP/wstg
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
           https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes made to the original in this repository:
  - Extracted the 97 v4.2 test cases from the published PDF into plain Markdown.
  - Removed PDF artifacts (page headers/numbers, form feeds) and normalized
    typographic ligatures (e.g. "fi", "fl").
  - Reorganized the text into one file per category, and split the Input
    Validation category into six files by injection class.
  - Added per-file tables of contents.
  - Derived the coverage checklist (resources/wstg-checklist.csv) and the report
    template (resources/report-template.md) from WSTG test names and the WSTG
    Reporting chapter.

Because the WSTG is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0, the adapted materials listed in
LICENSE-DOCS remain under CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution to OWASP is required and is
provided here and in the README. Per-test canonical references use versioned
links of the form:
